  bx('ca', '<span class="tag">In the news · September 2026 (verify dates)</span><b>Hindi Diwas (14 Sep)</b> marks Hindi adoption after the Munshi-Ayyangar Formula. <b>Tamil Nadu Assembly</b> resolution urges Centre to recognise Tamil with English as principal language of Madras HC. <b>Tulu:</b> Karnataka Cabinet made it second additional administrative language for Dakshina Kannada and Udupi.'),
